Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Miss Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.62,0:00:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready to start the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.70,0:00:09.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.61,0:00:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.62,0:00:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sister, you're too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.28,0:00:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray, I didn't hear you come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my apologies, and good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.48,0:00:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've turned up dreadfully late today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fortunately for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.48,0:00:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sister took care of my preparations,\Nand she was absolutely amazing at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.42,0:00:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I have a lot of practice from\Ntaking care of you when we were younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.98,0:00:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.16,0:00:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But seeing Tim as Claire's\Ndaily needs is my obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.28,0:00:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Occupation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.19,0:00:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I wouldn't feel right\Nmaking you do my work for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.70,0:00:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were about to say something\Nunnerving and cough to cover it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.90,0:00:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really isn't a bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.66,0:00:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm actually enjoying every minute of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.34,0:00:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, Claire, you should\Nlet me help you out every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.06,0:00:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How would you like to\Nhave me as your maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.18,0:00:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sister, you have to stop\Nteasing me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:00:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do apologize, love.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.66,0:01:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just so adorable when you blush.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.66,0:01:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, come with me, my princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.30,0:01:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to escort you to the dining hall.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:13.55,0:01:16.84,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Must you tell me every thought that crosses your mind?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.14,0:01:19.81,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I've gotta tell you how I feel!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.97,0:01:22.77,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Are you so unaware of how different our worlds are?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.06,0:01:25.95,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Then let's bring up a revolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.32,0:01:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want me no hold on?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.95,0:01:28.91,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Do you know? Who I am
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.91,0:01:31.94,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Yes, I know! That sky-high pride of yours
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.94,0:01:34.96,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}What you want? Tell me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.22,0:01:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.30,0:01:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I want only you!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.96,0:01:37.28,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}All I want! Only you!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.28,0:01:41.17,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}No matter how immersive this game may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.30,0:01:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want me no hold on?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.17,0:01:43.66,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Aren't you way too into it?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.66,0:01:45.29,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}If I do it differently,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.90,0:01:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want only you. Do
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.29,0:01:47.13,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}there won't be a happy ending
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.13,0:01:49.54,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}What nonsense are you babbling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.52,0:01:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you want me no hold on?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.73,0:01:53.05,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}My wildest fantasies became my reality…
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.05,0:01:55.55,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Ah, cool! You're cool! Beautiful!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.74,0:01:58.80,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Bringing such disruption to my once peaceful days…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.34,0:02:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know that the world is\Nnot easy. I can't believe you,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.14,0:02:01.56,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I can't believe! You have to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.24,0:02:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you I can't believe you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.48,0:02:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you If\Nyou want to see you,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.77,0:02:03.43,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Love and hate both,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.43,0:02:09.67,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Without a partner, those feelings can never start!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.96,0:02:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let's make a difference
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.31,0:02:12.28,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}So raise your hands!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.28,0:02:16.07,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}It's time to give in to happiness!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.72,0:02:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm the only one.\NChoice. I'm the only one.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.07,0:02:21.03,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}There's only one right choice here:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.26,0:02:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Choice from the heart. Raise\Nyour hands, give it up.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.03,0:02:22.91,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}from the bottom of your heart, hold up and
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.91,0:02:25.66,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Raise your hands! Surrender already!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.66,0:02:28.96,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! Throw 'em up and celebrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise your hands,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.96,0:02:31.75,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.44,0:02:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take your hands
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.75,0:02:34.38,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! For this fantastic world!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.22,0:02:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you forget to leave it alone?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.38,0:02:38.26,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}I won't give up until you tell me what you're planning!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.78,0:02:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you
Dialogue: 1,0:02:38.26,0:02:41.10,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}You're so awesome! I love you!
