Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.20,0:03:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Lene?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.08,0:03:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look a little ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.76,0:03:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm suffering from Miss Claire withdrawal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.20,0:03:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, it sounds like\Neverything's normal then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.52,0:03:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sleep well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.16,0:03:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you not leave\Nme in my time of need?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.38,0:03:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Manaria is a menace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.12,0:03:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not even getting quality\Nproperly and she's feeding Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.62,0:03:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claire with a spoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.56,0:03:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, not cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.12,0:03:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should've been me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.24,0:03:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.15,0:03:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is beyond illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.56,0:03:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.48,0:03:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you do something\Nto offend the princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.55,0:03:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, this might be a good\Nchance for you to get over Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.64,0:03:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.55,0:03:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never will I!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.47,0:03:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My existence is dedicated to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.52,0:03:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she's not in my world, then I\Nmight as well drop dead! No, Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.50,0:03:44.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.41,0:03:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Means no life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.33,0:03:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose you'll\Nhave to fight for her then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.80,0:03:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.74,0:03:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.68,0:03:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure I'd be playing right\Ninto princess minaria's hands what do you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.28,0:03:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mean by that it feels like she's trying\Nto provoke me then your only choice is
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.20,0:04:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to put up with it at least that way you\Ncan still spend some time with miss claire
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.12,0:04:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right in the game princess Manaria shows
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.50,0:04:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up and becomes an ally to the heroine
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.58,0:04:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why would she be taking Miss Claire's\Nside? It doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.94,0:04:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess in the end it doesn't matter as\Nlong as Miss Claire is happy. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.74,0:04:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was so down after losing Lene, but now\Nshe's finally started smiling again and
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.74,0:04:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i know it's because of her so i'm grateful
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.54,0:04:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to princess Manaria at least i think so
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.86,0:04:44.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Pepi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.68,0:04:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As expected,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.88,0:05:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a big monster extermination is being\Nplanned for this year's Amor ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.94,0:05:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the ceremony?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.85,0:05:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.77,0:05:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monsters will be drawn to the forest by\Nthe magic stone and the scales of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.46,0:05:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not very strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.96,0:05:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they arrive in greater numbers\Nthan the military can handle alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.22,0:05:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna take everyone in this\Nacademy to help take them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.98,0:05:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To ensure everyone's safety on the day,\Nwe'll need to act in groups of three.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.42,0:05:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I advise you to coordinate your teams now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.76,0:05:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May I have the honor of\Nbeing on a team with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.32,0:05:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.23,0:05:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing would please me more\Nthan to have you by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.72,0:05:31.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where I'm gonna be too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.26,0:05:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ceremony's so close, you can\Nalmost feel the excitement in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.68,0:05:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, how is the winner determined\Nwhen the suitors make their offerings?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.82,0:05:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely it can't be as simple as\Nwhichever one is heavier, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.30,0:05:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.21,0:05:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Physical weight has nothing\Nto do with the outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.54,0:05:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not the offerings the scales weigh,\Nbut the strength of the suitor's feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.78,0:05:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.69,0:05:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.61,0:05:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the winner was determined by how\Ndifficult their offering was to obtain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.48,0:06:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weightiest offerings\Nare the flowers of flora.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.40,0:06:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With those on the scales,\Na suitor is certain to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.98,0:06:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're talking about the flowers of\Nlight mentioned in Poesia Moor, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.64,0:06:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They really exist?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.32,0:06:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yes, but they're incredibly\Nrare and grow in hard-to-reach places.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.46,0:06:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ceremony really follows the\Nlegend down to the last detail, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.36,0:06:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.12,0:06:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Personally, I don't think Poesia\NMoor is a very good story.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.10,0:06:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never really liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.54,0:06:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what makes you say that? I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.24,0:06:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why couldn't the priestess just choose\Nwhich one of the men she wanted to be with?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.64,0:06:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost like she wanted\Nthem to fight over her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.66,0:06:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pretty villainous of her if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.34,0:06:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's an unfair assessment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.66,0:06:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, I think she simply couldn't decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.76,0:06:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you truly fall in love, it\Nmust be an overwhelming experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.58,0:06:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,making it difficult for even you\Nyourself to discern how you really feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.62,0:06:57.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe that's how\Nit works for some people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.26,0:06:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what they say, love is blind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.98,0:07:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I don't think\Nthat's quite what they meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.14,0:07:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray, would you mind\Npouring me some more tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.62,0:07:12.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. It's empty, but\NI'll go make another pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.74,0:07:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, please do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.98,0:07:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and there's no need to rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.26,0:07:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the contrary, I very\Nmuch think there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.26,0:07:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we should go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.84,0:07:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that we'll see\Nyou around sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.22,0:07:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that was rather strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.78,0:07:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.72,0:07:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Peppy and Loretta?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.48,0:07:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I meant the commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.56,0:07:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her behavior has been questionable lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.96,0:07:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you observe Ray\Npretty closely, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.10,0:07:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.62,0:07:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be a very\Nresponsible master if I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.62,0:07:48.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.53,0:07:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet you don't know\Nwhat's wrong with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.10,0:07:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.01,0:07:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was it you said before?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.06,0:07:55.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About love being blind?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.52,0:07:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, what was that? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.30,0:08:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.10,0:08:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to have a word with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.90,0:08:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey there, Minibus Squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.66,0:08:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I can't remember your real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.54,0:08:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only are you the most insulent\Ncommoner ever, you're also quite stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.24,0:08:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize, there's only enough room\Nin my brain for Miss Claire's wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.22,0:08:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, what do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.82,0:08:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Frankly, I can't comprehend half\Nof the things you say or do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.84,0:08:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.14,0:08:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wanted to ask if you're being honest\Nabout your feelings for Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.00,0:08:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.78,0:08:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, no matter what happens, you must\Npromise you'll protect Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.46,0:08:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're her personal maid, so you can\Nguard her from morning until night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.36,0:08:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you have to go up against royalty?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.76,0:08:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What royalty?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.90,0:08:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, are you talking\Nabout Princess Manaria?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.36,0:08:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hush, don't speak so loudly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.34,0:08:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okie dokie, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.50,0:08:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take that as a yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.68,0:08:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We heard that Princess Manaria has, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.58,0:09:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's say, a track record among the\Nladies of the night in her kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.72,0:09:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rumor's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.63,0:09:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People spread the strangest things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.86,0:09:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But regardless, if anything\Nhappens to Miss Claire,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.44,0:09:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know that we'll be looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.06,0:09:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loretta, I can't help but wonder if we\Nasked the wrong person to help us with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.22,0:09:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I simply can't process it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.08,0:09:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, good night, Miss Clare.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.76,0:09:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.04,0:09:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I admire your patience, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.94,0:09:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have a moment to talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.16,0:09:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in love with\NMiss Clare, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.10,0:09:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet you've been awfully well-behaved\Nlately, even after all my provocations.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.78,0:09:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.08,0:09:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were trying to provoke me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.96,0:09:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do love Miss Clare, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.44,0:09:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, I've never expected\Nher to return my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.00,0:09:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing that matters\Nto me is her happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.80,0:10:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.02,0:10:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize your feelings\Nfor her were so shallow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.08,0:10:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.38,0:10:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.36,0:10:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean my feelings\Nfor her are shallow?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.18,0:10:12.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Figure of speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.54,0:10:13.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I hit a nerve?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.66,0:10:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.04,0:10:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With all due respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.34,0:10:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the way I feel for Miss Claire is\Nsomething you could never comprehend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.04,0:10:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet you're giving up on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.90,0:10:23.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not giving up on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.72,0:10:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already told you I'm\Nputting her happiness first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.62,0:10:28.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you're being a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.54,0:10:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you had a spine, you would fight to make\Nher happier than anyone else ever could.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.42,0:10:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.44,0:10:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd do anything to make Miss Claire\Nhappy for as long as she'd let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.80,0:10:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm a commoner, and we're both girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.68,0:10:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not what she wants in a partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.20,0:10:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'd never make her as\Nhappy as she deserves to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.68,0:10:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't run.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.28,0:10:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not running.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.72,0:10:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.63,0:10:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then try to take her back from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.70,0:11:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounds like you're\Ntrying to pick a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.02,0:11:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.18,0:11:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you just figure that out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.66,0:11:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just as weak as your love for Claire\Nis, and I'm going to make you face it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.34,0:11:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll thank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.48,0:11:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm doing you both a kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.38,0:11:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to fight, you've got one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.28,0:11:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.19,0:11:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I hoped you'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.06,0:11:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, meet me after school\Ntomorrow at the Magic Practice Ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.00,0:11:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.74,0:11:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My love isn't weak, and\NI'll prove it to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.68,0:11:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's going up against\NRay Taylor this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ought to be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.32,0:11:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think will win?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.46,0:11:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sister, I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.84,0:11:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What made you decide to\Ngo through with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.76,0:11:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a friendly test of skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.94,0:11:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to go when you are, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.20,0:11:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Took you long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.40,0:12:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.96,0:12:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.98,0:12:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.36,0:12:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you both ready? Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.06,0:12:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.97,0:12:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On your marks, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.98,0:12:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see what you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.42,0:12:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And straight to the pitfall trap that\Nwon her the match against Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.98,0:12:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a somewhat effective strategy, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.78,0:12:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a bad opener.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.46,0:12:31.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you still don't have what\Nit takes to win against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.70,0:12:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.61,0:12:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might want to look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.48,0:12:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water Meteor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.78,0:12:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sister, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.98,0:12:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A fusion of earth and water magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.10,0:12:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's some pretty insane power she has.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.22,0:12:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even Manaria is having trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.22,0:12:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.22,0:12:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.36,0:12:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got my clothes all wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.80,0:13:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An exceptional level wind spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.52,0:13:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Teleport.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.12,0:13:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way that played out, I'd say she must\Nhave had some idea of what was coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.80,0:13:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's still tough to deflect.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.28,0:13:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm insulted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.66,0:13:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This better not mean that she was\Nholding back against me during our duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.04,0:13:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going all-in right\Nfrom the start, Rae.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.68,0:13:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't exactly have much of a choice\Nwhen I'm up against someone like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.22,0:13:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Manaria can use Spellbreaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.74,0:13:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the battle drags out, she'll\Nanalyze all my spells and erase them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.00,0:13:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not taking that chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.12,0:13:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.16,0:13:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not about to call\Nit quits now, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.48,0:13:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.39,0:13:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.68,0:13:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This move is a high-level\Nspell that players
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.10,0:13:55.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,normally can't use until\Nthe end of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.08,0:13:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chain spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.32,0:13:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Code, hide it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.74,0:14:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the highest level of\Nattack I have right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.76,0:14:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.20,0:14:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.66,0:14:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was very close.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.88,0:14:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it was anyone else you were up against,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.36,0:14:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you probably would have\Njust won the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.70,0:14:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you manage to dodge all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.58,0:14:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not telling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.84,0:14:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Teleport, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.06,0:14:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, there wasn't quite enough time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.12,0:14:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reaction speeds off the\Ncharts like everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.84,0:14:32.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me something, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.32,0:14:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think that was a bit too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.98,0:14:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we are under a\Nmagic dampening barrier,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.38,0:14:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if that had hit me directly, I would\Nhave been more than just a bit injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.48,0:14:45.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet you evaded it\Nwithout breaking a sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.48,0:14:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, consider who you're battling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.08,0:14:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you managed to give me such an\Nentertaining show, maybe I'll return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.86,0:14:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I know what's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.48,0:14:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have to use Academy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.38,0:15:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.58,0:15:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.94,0:15:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have nothing to counter with.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.12,0:15:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.24,0:15:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dominator.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.22,0:15:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dominator, a spell that\Nuses all four attributes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.54,0:15:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It takes control of the victim's\Nmagic and makes it go berserk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.52,0:15:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the most brutal\Nattack spell there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.54,0:15:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And against another spellcaster,\Nthe ultimate weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.16,0:16:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commoner!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.07,0:16:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.86,0:16:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.00,0:16:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commoner! Commoner!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.68,0:16:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.98,0:16:18.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commoner!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.89,0:16:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.20,0:16:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Step aside, Claire. I'll heal her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.28,0:16:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.52,0:16:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's going to be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.24,0:16:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.24,0:16:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't necessary to go that far!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.32,0:16:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your standard magic and spellbreaker would
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.20,0:16:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have been more than\Nenough to win the duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.72,0:16:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you just had to keep pushing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.42,0:16:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if the worst had happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.28,0:16:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could have killed her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.00,0:16:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was always a barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.88,0:16:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even Dominator couldn't have\Ninflicted lethal damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.26,0:16:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, I have to admit it was\Nmore powerful than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.58,0:16:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray must have quite a bit of\Nmagic if it hurt her that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.36,0:17:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you be so calm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.10,0:17:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You worry about her a\Nlot, don't you, Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.24,0:17:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.66,0:17:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.82,0:17:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I win?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.24,0:17:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, you lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.92,0:17:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.92,0:17:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.78,0:17:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew that Princess Manaria had\Nthe ability to use Dominator.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.92,0:17:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know everything about\Nthe world of this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.94,0:17:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And because of that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.54,0:17:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A deal is a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.68,0:17:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been defeated,\Nand now Claire is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.90,0:17:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.16,0:18:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can never beat her.
