Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.57,0:18:58.80,ed_eng_11_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}It's important to shield your heart
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.80,0:19:01.01,ed_eng_11_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}With a strong facade
Dialogue: 1,0:19:01.01,0:19:03.89,ed_eng_11_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}No one wishes for their fantasies to flourish,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.89,0:19:04.81,ed_eng_11_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Do they?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.83,0:19:06.58,ed_eng_11_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}I don't want to be hurt,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.58,0:19:08.96,ed_eng_11_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}If we can't be together,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.96,0:19:11.42,ed_eng_11_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}Then there's only one thing I want to do!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.89,0:19:17.72,ed_eng_11_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}She is my wonder girl of world!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.72,0:19:21.66,ed_eng_11_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Someone who I had no chance to see in my world,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.72,0:19:21.66,ed_eng_11_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)\3c&HF97107&}Someone who I could never meet back in my world,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.70,0:19:25.62,ed_eng_11_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}As we grow close to each other,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.62,0:19:30.65,ed_eng_11_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}My feelings keep growing stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.48,0:20:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.48,0:20:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.12,0:20:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave her be for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.26,0:20:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's fine. Foolish girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.98,0:20:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were instructed to\Nform teams for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.54,0:20:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.56,0:20:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray will be perfectly safe on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.66,0:20:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing's going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.96,0:20:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.94,0:20:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You left my side without\Nso much as a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.68,0:20:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.90,0:20:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A servant should never abandon her master.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.92,0:20:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.83,0:20:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wandering off by yourself when you haven't\Ngotten your full strength back yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.64,0:20:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's rash and irresponsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.46,0:20:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.26,0:20:53.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have Princess Manaria, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.58,0:20:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world's one and only quadcaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.34,0:20:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With her to protect you, you\Nshould be perfectly safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.58,0:21:01.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My safety isn't what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.52,0:21:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something has been bothering you, and ever\Nsince the duel, it's only gotten worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.30,0:21:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine. Nothing's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.28,0:21:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't lie to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.70,0:21:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way you're acting, even\NRalaire won't go near you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.92,0:21:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.26,0:21:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So quiet, it's frightening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.64,0:21:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to know the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.40,0:21:27.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We fought that duel with you\Nas the stakes, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.60,0:21:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.64,0:21:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.04,0:21:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have the right to\Nstay by your side anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.94,0:21:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of all the ridiculous,\Nyou were fighting over me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.36,0:21:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not something to be one!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.84,0:21:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.88,0:21:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.28,0:21:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes you feel good, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.12,0:21:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being wanted by someone as\Namazing as Princess Manaria?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.70,0:21:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was your first love,\Nright? Your prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.24,0:21:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am your master.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.14,0:22:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're my maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.82,0:22:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kindly act like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.84,0:22:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're sulking like a child, running from\Neverything because you lost one match?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.04,0:22:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.14,0:22:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be ashamed of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.78,0:22:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ashamed of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.60,0:22:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.74,0:22:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you continue to behave like this, then\Nyou will no longer be fit to serve me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.96,0:22:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That works out well, because I quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.04,0:22:27.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.64,0:22:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm quitting my job as your maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.52,0:22:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you actually mean that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.02,0:22:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.36,0:22:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.10,0:22:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may have had a few complaints,\Nbut you have served me competently.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.78,0:22:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On behalf of the Francois\Nfamily, I offer my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.54,0:22:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please accept, Miss Taylor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.38,0:23:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.34,0:23:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing keeping you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.40,0:23:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize for all of the\Nselfish demands I've made of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.28,0:23:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever your future holds,\NI pray you find happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.26,0:23:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've made a mistake, haven't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.62,0:23:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be going, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.82,0:23:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A fatal mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.28,0:23:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One that I can't take back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.44,0:23:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.30,0:23:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're leaving just like\Neveryone else in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.08,0:23:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.28,0:24:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You.
